          "docs": {
            "tags": [],
            "text": "Hide the footer (Cancel/Submit) entirely — for dialogs that are dismissed by\nthe × / backdrop and have no explicit confirm action (e.g. the Weather panel)."
          },
          "internal": false,
          "getter": false,
          "setter": false
        },
        {
          "name": "headerBar",
          "type": "boolean",
          "attribute": "header-bar",
          "reflect": false,
          "mutable": false,
          "required": false,
          "optional": false,
          "defaultValue": "false",
          "complexType": {
            "original": "boolean",
            "resolved": "boolean",
            "references": {}
          },
          "docs": {
            "tags": [],
            "text": "Opt into a slotted HEADER BAR: a single flex row laid out as\n  `[ slot=\"header\" …flex-grows… ] [ slot=\"header-actions\" ] [ × close ]`\nso the consumer supplies its OWN title + right-side control (a list-select, a\nroom switcher, …) INLINE with the close/action buttons — nothing overlaps the\n×, and the consumer's control can't be clipped in the top-right corner.\n\nWhen false (the default) the dialog keeps its legacy chrome: the absolutely\npositioned round × plus an optional `dialogTitle` heading. Existing consumers\nthat pass `dialogTitle` are unaffected — this is purely additive."
          },
          "internal": false,
          "getter": false,
          "setter": false
        }
